// RISE-GUI Windows Resource File
//
// Application icon, mirroring the macOS client's AppIcon.appiconset
// (build/XCode/rise/RISE-GUI/Assets.xcassets/AppIcon.appiconset/) --
// app_icon.ico was generated from that set's app_logo_1024.png and
// contains 16/32/48/64/256 px frames (see icons/ and Theme.cpp for the
// in-app SVG icon system; this .ico is only the .exe/taskbar/Alt-Tab
// icon, which Windows requires in ICO container form rather than SVG).
//
// This .rc is compiled via the <ResourceCompile Include="RISE-GUI.rc" />
// item in RISE-GUI.vcxproj (see VCXPROJ_NOTES.md item 1, now resolved).
// Plain numeric resource ID (no resource.h in this project to supply an
// IDI_ICON1-style macro) -- id 1 is the conventional "first/main icon"
// slot and is what the linker/loader picks up as the .exe's default
// icon when there's exactly one ICON resource in the module.
1 ICON "app_icon.ico"
